      "role": "user",
      "content": "the relief you're talking about... it sounds almost peaceful. like, i'm just so tired of fighting to be someone that isn't even there anymore. sometimes i think i was only ever me because of him. now that he's gone, it's like my soul just isn't in my body. part of me feels like i'm already half-way there, just drifting away from everything.",
